      "finding": "Products pushed to a clinic land as 'proposed' catalog links that the clinic must accept (vendor-catalog-push/index.ts at v1.1.345).",
      "proposed_text": "To offer a product to a clinic, push it from Push to clinic; the clinic reviews and accepts new products before they can use them.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "Push to clinic",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/vendor/VendorCatalogPage.tsx"
